Frau Krüger and I are standing in the hallway.
The suitcase stands on the floor.
It stands right next to the door.
I have the key for my new flat.
I turn the key in the lock.
I open the door slowly.
I go into the flat.
The ceilings are very high.
The windows are large and bright.
I look through the window at the courtyard.
Frau Krüger is still standing in the hallway.
"Good luck with the move, Frau Flores," she says.
She smiles kindly.
"Thank you very much for the help, Frau Krüger," I answer.
She goes back to her flat.
I stand alone in the flat.
My backpack is still lying outside on the suitcase.
I am finally in my real home.
